                        "language": "english",
                        "review": " I think it's a fun game if you like the period. Gameplay can be really slow if on foot, but having horses speeds it up a lot. The buffs and upgrades in regions were neat. It's a challenge to save every man in your force, but fun if you take the time. \n   Maybe it's the Southron in me talking, but it was a refreshing indie game experience.\n    I look forward to more of Tilted Mill's future releases!",
